Modifications relative to upstream:
- post_processing/model_utils.py: POPO_CONFIGS multi-endpoint configuration,
  per-endpoint timeout (POPO_API_TIMEOUT), POPO_MAX_TOKENS, and optional
  POPO_TEMPERATURE override (unset = omit the parameter so the serving-side
  sampling proxy injects official defaults; set 0 for greedy decoding, 1 to
  replicate legacy explicit behavior).

The vLLM engine image and model weights referenced by deploy/ are separate
artifacts; weights are not redistributed (see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).
